      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "YOU GLANCE\nOne pill in the header answers\n\"is my vault current?\" — green,\nor the single reason it isn't.\nThat is the whole status check.",
