      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "YOU JUDGE\nTriage the Inbox. Accept or reject\nproposed commitments. These are\nthe only two things a machine\nis not allowed to decide.",
